 "Loading lessons...": "正在加载经验教训……",
 "<strong>Lessons</strong> are portable heuristics — short imperative rules (always/never/prefer/avoid) extracted from past work. Auto-surface from JSONL imports (low confidence, tag <code>auto-import</code>), get reinforced when the agent applies them, and decay if unused. Higher confidence = more battle-tested.": "<strong>经验教训</strong> 是从过去工作中提取的可复用启发式规则——简短的祈使规则（always/never/prefer/avoid）。它们会从 JSONL 导入中自动出现（低置信度，标签为 <code>auto-import</code>），在 agent 应用后得到强化，并在闲置时衰减。置信度越高，说明经过的验证越多。",
 "Search lessons...": "搜索经验教训……",
 "No lessons yet": "暂无经验教训",
